        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The marinade does the work here, so the chicken needs at least an hour in it. A hot griddle gives the slightly charred edges that make this worth eating. Get everything ready before you start cooking because it comes together fast."}]
      },
